# B2B Data Provider

## Architecture
- Frontend: GitHub Pages (HTML/CSS/JS)
- Backend: Google Apps Script
- Database: Google Sheets

## Setup

### 1. Google Apps Script
1. Go to https://script.google.com
2. Create new project
3. Paste Code.gs content
4. Deploy → New deployment → Web app
5. Execute as: Me
6. Access: Anyone
7. Copy the URL

### 2. GitHub Pages
1. Upload index.html to GitHub repo
2. Settings → Pages → main branch
3. Access your page

### 3. Connect
1. Open your GitHub Pages URL
2. Paste Apps Script URL in configuration
3. Start using!
